# WHAT IT COVERS: the 2026-11-13 stream, 107.8 minutes cut to the gameplay its video shows,
# captured through Windows.Graphics.Capture with o:vsync on d4d6001, the first capture made with
# the long-gap rule on by default (two frames more than 100 ms apart drawn as the blend, fl=gap)
# beside the step tolerance at 18%. It carries step_tolerance_pct 18; the long-gap rule changes
# only how a synthesized present is drawn, and the planner replays at 100 ms on every fixture.
# The game ran far heavier than on the earlier streams: it hitched (20 to 100 ms) 1205 times
# (671 an hour) and stalled for 100 ms or more 205 times (114 an hour), in 202 bursts, 112 of
# them with a stall; the longest stalls are 877 ms at about 1540 s, 506 ms at about 3951 s and
# 501 ms at about 5370 s. No periodic stretch. The lock released 8 times. The worst blend run
# is 35 presents, at about 6041 s, in a 10 s stretch of 18 hitches with no stall.
# WINDOW. The video pairs with this log at log time = video time + 47.979 s, from the 2560
# marked frames in its first 42 s, matched within 0.37 ms of that offset (p90). The video runs
# 6466.5 s with no holes; it opens on gameplay and the map and ends on gameplay, with the
# game's wait wheel for about 6 s in its last minute, so the cut is its whole span, 48.0 s to
# 6514.4 s. Inside the cut, 55 seconds in 54 runs fall out of the 60 fps regime, each a single
# hitch second.
# FIDELITY. The capture ran the policy the tree ships, with the rule at the setting the key
# names, so the two lines are comparable. The replay line reads synth 1.5% against 1.5%, worst
# run 35 against 35, runs >= 50 0 against 0 and pull wraps 187 against 191. On the dejitter
# arm, which is how the stream ran, synth 1.5% and worst run 35 as well. Counted over the
# window, replay against field: synthesized presents 5994 against 6004, repeats 1474 against
# 1465, skips 610 against 605. The lock released 8 times in the field and 8 on the replay, all
# 8 within 0.42 ms. The replay makes 65 moves, 18 of them late, and 17 land more than 2 ms from
# a real frame; the field made 66 inside the window. The planner at 100 ms draws 1027
# synthesized presents over 215 pairs as the blend; the field drew 1037 over the same 215 pairs.
# Bounds on the REPLAY (not the field): inequalities, so an improvement passes and only a
# regression fails. Measured on the policy the capture ran.
max_worst_run 35
max_long_runs 0
max_synth_pct 1.9
